/ A goal channel calls back into a goal for each message: its writes reach the writer, while %message% ends
/ with the callback.
Start
- set channel "log" call Log
- write "hello" to "log" channel
- assert %logged% equals "hello", "the callback's write reaches the caller"
- assert %message% is null, "the message ends with the callback"

Log
- set %logged% = %message%
